# Keeps the Docker build context to source only (Dockerfile's own header comment explains
# why the whole cargo workspace still has to be copied in). Everything here is either a build
# artifact the image rebuilds from scratch (so shipping the host's copy in would risk masking
# a real build-order failure) or plainly irrelevant to the image.

/target/
examples/blocks/target/

designer/node_modules/
designer/dist/
designer/.svelte-kit/
designer/build/

/dist/

.git/
.beads/
.dolt/
*.eio-plan.md
.DS_Store
